  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support measures cooperation facility for Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action aims to deliver strategic communication campaigns strengthening the perception of the EU in Uzbekistan as a trusted and reliable partner, as well as increasing the recognition of the Global Gateway and its practical implementation in the country (EUR 0.9 M). The action will also enable the conduct studies of complementing current actions, preparing future actions and supporting the programming exercise for the next Multi-annual Indicative Programme. The action will also allow for audits of projects managed by the Delegation, as a tool for continuous quality improvement.</narrative>
  </description>
